Hello! There is first update for Hentai vs Evil live on Steam!

Changelist:

Weapon pickups now highlighted by icon;
"Start Game" text renamed to "DIFFICULTY"
Added timer to show how much time left for bonus ammo;
Ammo icon now colored as the current ammo type;
Ammo Boxes now become easier to open;
There are no blood decals and particles when you hit skeletons;
Easy mode is became more easy;
Fixed enemy spawns in the pirate map;
More ammo bonuses at the pirate map;
Russian localization fix;

